        ],
        "description": "Identifies processes started from binaries whose SHA-256 hash matches a Flint Ratchet botnet sample, as reported in campaign PTF-01529. The indicators are synthetic and use reserved address and domain ranges, so they match no real traffic.",
        "false_positives": [
            "Security testing that replays known indicators.",
            "A shared hosting address or domain that later served benign content."
        ],
        "from": "now-9m",
        "index": [
            "logs-endpoint.events.process-*"
        ],
        "language": "eql",
        "license": "Elastic License v2",
        "name": "Flint Ratchet Botnet: Process started from known malicious binary (PTF-01529)",
        "note": "## Triage and analysis\n\n### Investigating Flint Ratchet Botnet: Process started from known malicious binary\n\nThis rule matches indicators that the Partner Threat Feed attributes to the Flint Ratchet botnet in campaign PTF-01529.\n\n### Possible investigation steps\n\n- Review the matching event and the host or user it came from.\n- Look for other indicators from the same campaign on the same host.\n- Check the process tree around the event for the initial execution or delivery.\n\n### Response and remediation\n\n- Isolate the host if the match is confirmed.\n- Block the indicators at the network edge and on endpoints.\n- Reset credentials used on the host.\n",
        "query": "process where event.type == \"start\" and process.hash.sha256 in (\"a0d722a657f1cd2b2f496463a537f6ac057c42fe2f2d0626455b0ef8d36380b1\", \"81685e44529833001bc51d720755997ae2dc3c62caf90a1494ee2c7c530d9594\", \"2760ef4c8d928bf853491bf318d936da1efd3e3e04938306e66566bbb315dd4f\", \"3fac8396556e2c027754265fbbfb471afca03401a59a91ae714d222b179a9702\", \"b80dc225f91e4c57e25196891d295159c5622abdcaaa0fcb27060a1baf736720\", \"e30d5396966e6fb9814eb50319cd3d9e50aa47bf37288dbe469bf957c684e15c\", \"26a286a25dc1b0ee92281d7e74d1489ef3b8b0ae3d9caec03164cea65dcf9b20\", \"7dc7acf335b780a30592babb09db50e6ddba65d994891abab4bb9c980abc1439\", \"36584e806fa398ba35ed4d68a79b646afbcdc48d0b195f5834d352258579ccc4\")",
